        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "19845c27-305e-5548-b047-999fc116afd5",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Richard Schiff, David Shore, Daniel Dae Kim, Yunjin Kim\n- TV series: The Good Doctor, Lost\n- Companies: ABC, 3AD\n- Roles: Dr. Glassman, Sun Kwon, Jin Kwon\n- Places: San José, California, South Korea\n\nFacts:\n- In 2013, the South Korean series The Good Doctor originated the format later used by the American television series of the same name.\n- The American medical-drama television series The Good Doctor was developed by David Shore based on the 2013 South Korean series The Good Doctor.\n- Daniel Dae Kim runs the film and television production company 3AD.\n- 3AD is producing the television series The Good Doctor.\n- In September 2017, Richard Schiff began appearing in ABC's prime time drama series The Good Doctor in a leading role as Dr. Glassman.\n- In The Good Doctor, Dr. Glassman is the president of a fictional teaching hospital in San José, California.\n- In the Lost episode The Whole Truth, flashbacks feature Sun Kwon, played by Yunjin Kim, and revolve around the fertility problems of Sun Kwon and Jin Kwon, played by Daniel Dae Kim.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
